@startuml singleton_before
class Repository {
  -conn
}
note right: every repo opened its own sqlite3.connect()\n(duplicate connections, inconsistent state)
@enduml

@startuml singleton_after
class DatabaseManager {
  -{static} _instance
  +{static} get_instance(path)
  +connection
  +transaction()
}
Repository --> DatabaseManager : uses single instance
@enduml

